# ============================================================================
# aichauffeur.ai — deploy exclusions
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The `aichauffeur` Vercel project has Root Directory = /chauffeur/, so this
# file governs that project and only that project. The AVA parent deploys from
# the repo root and never reads it.
#
# RUN 9 shipped DESIGN-SYSTEM.md into the bundle and blocked it in robots.txt
# instead, because there was no .vercelignore to add a line to and the run was
# not going to invent one against a live host mid-flight. robots.txt is a
# request to well-behaved crawlers, not an access control: the file was still
# fetchable by anyone who typed the path. It is the brand's engineering law —
# no keys, no private numbers — so this was always an exposure of intent rather
# than of secrets. It is now simply not deployed, which is the honest fix.
# ============================================================================
DESIGN-SYSTEM.md
